  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Promoting disaster resilience and social cohesion in northern and central Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.Improved national and sub-national capacities to anticipate, prevent and address multi-dimensional risks 2.Improved community resilience to disasters and violent conflict</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Address interrelated and mutually reinforcing risks facing Mozambique in a comprehensive and coherence approach in order to ensure that the needs of at-risk communities, and the current and future development investment are safeguarded against disasters and help prevent a new spiral of conflict and instability.&#xC7AC;&#xD574; &#xBC0F; &#xC704;&#xD5D8; &#xD574;&#xACB0;&#xC744; &#xC704;&#xD55C; &#xAC70;&#xBC84;&#xB10C;&#xC2A4; &#xAC15;&#xD654;, &#xC870;&#xAE30; &#xACBD;&#xBCF4; &#xC2DC;&#xC2A4;&#xD15C; &#xAC1C;&#xC120;, &#xC9C0;&#xC5ED;&#xC0AC;&#xD68C; &#xAE30;&#xBC18; &#xCDE8;&#xC57D;&#xACC4;&#xCE35; &#xBCF4;&#xD638; &#xAC15;&#xD654; &#xBC0F; &#xC0DD;&#xACC4; &#xC9C0;&#xC6D0;</narrative>
